<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('/partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('/partials/header') %>

<!-- HERO PHOTO -->
<section class="page-hero memorial">
  <div class="copy">
    <h1>Animal memorial<br>& <em>ossuary</em> services.</h1>
    <div class="jp-line">動物供養碑　—　Animal Memorial Garden</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MONUMENT -->
<section class="item">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="row">
    <div class="media"><div class="ph pl-b" style="background-image:url('<%= rootPath %>img/grounds/20.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center;"></div></div>
    <div class="text">
      <h3>Animal memorial and ossuary services are available.</h3>
      <p>At Myohokkein, pets are memorialised in a shared ossuary beneath a monument engraved with a phoenix.<br>
The ashes of pets that have already been cremated are interred together there.</p>
      <p>More than 1,000 animals rest beneath the monument — including dogs, cats, hamsters, birds,
lizards, turtles, pigs, and many others.</p>
<p>
  At the time of interment, a Buddhist memorial rite is performed together with the temple priests,
including the chanting of sutras. The ceremony usually lasts around 20–30 minutes.
</p>
<p>
  The animal memorial monument may be visited at any time, day or night.
Please be assured that the site is cared for daily,
with priests offering prayers and maintaining the grounds each morning.
</p>
<p class="open-24h">The Animal Memorial Garden is open 24 hours a day for visits.</p>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<!-- HOW TO APPLY -->
<section class="item" id="apply">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="row">
    <div class="media"><div class="ph pl-b" style="background-image:url('<%= rootPath %>img/grounds/19.png'); background-size:cover; background-position:center;"></div></div>
    <div class="text">
      <h3>How to Apply for<br><em>Animal Memorial Services</em></h3>
      <p>Please message us on Instagram with your name, your pet’s name, your pet’s type (dog, cat, etc.),
and a note that you would like to arrange interment.</p>
      <p>We will reply in English to discuss the date and details with you.</p>
      <p>Interment costs ¥33,000, plus an additional ¥7,000–¥20,000 depending on the size of the urn.</p>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<!-- YOUTUBE -->
<section class="item">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="row">
    <div class="media video">
      <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/EHqGAvW4iM0" title="Animal memorial service at Myohokkein" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen loading="lazy"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="text">
      <h3>See the service<br>on <em>YouTube</em>.</h3>
      <p>On YouTube, we share videos showing animal memorial services.</p>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-grid">
      <a class="cta-card" href="<%= rootPath %>about/">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Learn more</span>
          <h3>About the temple.</h3>
          <p>Learn about Myohokkein's history and the Nichiren Buddhist tradition.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="arrow">About</span>
      </a>
      <a class="cta-card image" href="<%= rootPath %>#access">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Plan a visit</span>
          <h3>Open daily, 9:00 — 17:00.</h3>
          <p>1 minute walk from Shinkaichi station.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="arrow">Access & hours</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('/partials/footer') %>

<script src="<%= rootPath %>site.js?v=<%= assetVersion %>"></script>
</body>
</html>
